#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:4 5560be28120c46048bdae29c2f6d46af
msgid "翻译与文档维护"
msgstr "Translations and documentation"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:6 44e1b3b64c464cabaffb1bc199d97e4b
msgid "手册、API 描述和编辑器界面使用不同的源文件。先确认内容归属，避免重复维护同一份翻译。"
msgstr ""
"The manual, API descriptions, and editor interface use different source files. Identify the owner"
" of a text before editing so each translation has one maintained source."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:9 2beff5f5bce1480ea20283f919f2ad4f
msgid "源文件与生成结果"
msgstr "Sources and generated outputs"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:14 b158755c3297444487c32e5174c88fdc
msgid "内容"
msgstr "Content"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:15 544119ae35cd410caa3f08317d6c4041
msgid "维护源文件"
msgstr "Maintained source"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:16 1f35c78edd10464cb8db9db625c5e0b0
msgid "中文手册"
msgstr "Chinese manual"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:17 b9c5d32b2729462e911fadeb215f5d2f
msgid "文档仓库的 ``source/*.rst`` 及其子目录，使用 reStructuredText。"
msgstr "``source/*.rst`` and its subdirectories in the documentation repository, using reStructuredText."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:18 34484a5129154e88b64c8858ae185c82
msgid "英文手册"
msgstr "English manual"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:19 1e3d3ec118764c31857da90b34eb0e9c
msgid "文档仓库的 ``locales/en/LC_MESSAGES/**/*.po``，由中文手册提取消息。"
msgstr ""
"``locales/en/LC_MESSAGES/**/*.po`` in the documentation repository, with messages extracted from "
"the Chinese manual."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:20 b378b10af1ce4be8ba5913bc29a03606
msgid "API 英文说明"
msgstr "English API descriptions"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:21 4cb71f54312d43d383b262f4ea58ff0e
msgid "插件仓库的 ``doc_classes/*.xml``。"
msgstr "``doc_classes/*.xml`` in the plugin repository."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:22 b378b10af1ce4be8ba5913bc29a03606
msgid "API 中文说明"
msgstr "Chinese API descriptions"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:23 45cb81862efd41eda0a55edca88a8020
msgid "插件仓库的 ``addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po``，供内置帮助和网站共用。"
msgstr ""
"``addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po`` in the plugin repository, shared by "
"built-in help and the website."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:24 d601388e958b4a2e8987d4ad759b0d42
msgid "编辑器属性与界面"
msgstr "Editor properties and interface"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:25 a8f58d1ba3b4490c8c0c70964a20bd74
msgid "插件中的属性与界面 CSV，使用 FMOD Translations 面板维护。"
msgstr "The plugin's property and interface CSV catalogs, maintained with the FMOD Translations panel."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:27 d90f9eff6bd440d2bfc44d70f7617706
msgid ""
"``classref/xml/``、``classref/translations/``、``classref/api.json`` "
"是文档发布快照；``source/classes/class_*.rst`` 是生成结果。API 内容先在插件仓库修改，再同步快照和生成页面。"
msgstr ""
"``classref/xml/``, ``classref/translations/``, and ``classref/api.json`` are documentation "
"release snapshots; ``source/classes/class_*.rst`` is generated output. Make API changes in the "
"plugin repository first, then synchronize snapshots and generate pages."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:30 69246c2009aa47b898a9d2f150159a10
msgid "修改手册与英文翻译"
msgstr "Edit the manual and English translation"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:32 d6ca6daef06e4f0681710d322c81a2a1
msgid "以下命令在文档仓库根目录执行。普通手册改动不需要安装 Godot 或 FMOD SDK："
msgstr ""
"Run the following commands from the documentation repository root. Ordinary manual changes do not"
" require Godot or the FMOD SDK:"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:34 0a4e155b57564cb59ed24014311b3636
msgid ""
"python -m pip install -r requirements.txt\n"
"python scripts/build_docs.py --gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p build/gettext -l en"
msgstr ""
"python -m pip install -r requirements.txt\n"
"python scripts/build_docs.py --gettext\n"
"sphinx-intl update -p build/gettext -l en"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:40 3a04e60321f34eccbab781c216a0a021
msgid "在对应 ``.po`` 文件中翻译新增或变更的消息，复核模糊匹配后移除 ``fuzzy`` 标记，再构建两种语言："
msgstr ""
"Translate new or changed messages in the matching ``.po`` files, review fuzzy matches and remove "
"their ``fuzzy`` flags, then build both languages:"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:42 fd94934e8bad430e8b210a2bc7257470
msgid "python scripts/build_docs.py"
msgstr "python scripts/build_docs.py"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:46 c49c74b9c06c47b391892606edfe4e84
msgid ""
"中文输出位于 ``build/html/zh_CN/``，英文位于 ``build/html/en/``；日志位于 ``build/logs/``。构建会把 Sphinx "
"警告视为失败，并检查类参考、锚点和本地链接。"
msgstr ""
"Chinese output is written to ``build/html/zh_CN/`` and English output to ``build/html/en/``, with"
" logs under ``build/logs/``. The build treats Sphinx warnings as errors and checks class "
"references, anchors, and local links."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:48 5ae275baca3e4706a70ac53e43faa001
msgid "手册 PO 保留 ``msgid``，只修改 ``msgstr``。源文档变化后重新提取消息，不另外复制一套英文 RST。"
msgstr ""
"Keep ``msgid`` unchanged in manual PO files and edit ``msgstr``. Extract messages again when the "
"source changes rather than maintaining a separate English RST tree."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:49 5985a63ec9b347b6afcba1da50306fe4
msgid "保留 API 名称、代码示例、``:ref:``、``:doc:`` 和链接目标，使用 :doc:`../glossary` 中一致的术语。"
msgstr ""
"Preserve API names, code examples, ``:ref:``, ``:doc:``, and link targets. Follow the terminology"
" in :doc:`../glossary`."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:50 19ce6be67554425db1d45560c0d4553e
msgid "API 类页面不进入手册 gettext 目录，它们直接使用插件 XML 和共享 API PO。"
msgstr ""
"API class pages are excluded from the manual gettext catalogs; they use the plugin XML and shared"
" API PO directly."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:53 0132315b87b84071b2d7271ddf00cf77
msgid "维护 API 描述与中文类帮助"
msgstr "Maintain API descriptions and Chinese help"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:55 4d8afbff5d7742e8a897ccb6807c88bf
msgid "英文 XML 的签名、默认值、单位、返回值和线程说明应与绑定一致。中文 PO 的每条消息对应完整 XML 描述，保留 ``[param]``、``[method]`` 等标记和格式占位符。"
msgstr ""
"Keep signatures, defaults, units, return values, and threading notes in English XML aligned with "
"the bindings. Each Chinese PO message corresponds to a complete XML description; preserve tags "
"such as ``[param]`` and ``[method]`` and all format placeholders."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:57 2354bc9a216441d0be9d3df311c0114f
msgid "文档仓库保留了 API 翻译维护工具。下面示例在文档仓库运行，假设插件仓库与之并列："
msgstr ""
"The documentation repository retains the API translation maintenance tool. Run this example from "
"the documentation repository, assuming the plugin checkout is a sibling directory:"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:59 2b79573fcad542809add15df42f0ca1a
msgid ""
"$plugin = (Resolve-Path ../godot-fmodplayer).Path\n"
"python scripts/documentation_translations.py update --xml-dir \"$plugin/doc_classes\" --po "
"\"$plugin/addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po\"\n"
"# Translate new messages and review fuzzy entries before checking.\n"
"python scripts/documentation_translations.py check --xml-dir \"$plugin/doc_classes\" --po "
"\"$plugin/addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po\" --strict"
msgstr ""
"$plugin = (Resolve-Path ../godot-fmodplayer).Path\n"
"python scripts/documentation_translations.py update --xml-dir \"$plugin/doc_classes\" --po "
"\"$plugin/addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po\"\n"
"# Translate new messages and review fuzzy entries before checking.\n"
"python scripts/documentation_translations.py check --xml-dir \"$plugin/doc_classes\" --po "
"\"$plugin/addons/fmod_player/translations/documentation/zh_CN.po\" --strict"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:66 04c3f446e8df48bd8b2e93e309eac36f
msgid "更新后的 PO 提交到插件仓库。未翻译或带 ``fuzzy`` 的条目在编辑器中回退英文；网站发布前的严格检查要求译文完整且已确认。"
msgstr ""
"Commit the updated PO in the plugin repository. Untranslated or fuzzy entries fall back to "
"English in the editor; the website's strict publication checks require complete, reviewed "
"translations."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:68 dcd9c07f9bf644c9babc2db47274e21c
#, python-format
msgid ""
"API 接口变更时先构建并同步测试插件，再用文档仓库的 ``scripts/export_classref_api.gd`` 导出 ClassDB，运行 "
"``scripts/sync_classref.py`` 同步 XML、API 和 PO 快照。完整导出命令见 `文档仓库 README 的类参考说明 "
"<https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/godot-fmodplayer-docs#%E7%B1%BB%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83>`_。"
msgstr ""
"For API changes, build and stage the test addon, export ClassDB with "
"``scripts/export_classref_api.gd`` from the documentation repository, and use "
"``scripts/sync_classref.py`` to synchronize the XML, API, and PO snapshots. See the `class-"
"reference section of the documentation repository README <https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/godot-"
"fmodplayer-docs#%E7%B1%BB%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83>`_ for the complete export commands."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:70 a598b7e1de454426a8cd2d65201cc99b
msgid ""
"只修改说明或 PO 时无需重编译插件，可使用同一接口构建的 ClassDB 导出。同步后运行 ``python scripts/build_docs.py``，通过 :ref:`class_* "
"<class_FmodServer>` 和 ``enum_*`` 标签引用类与枚举，不手改生成页面。"
msgstr ""
"Description-only or PO-only changes do not require rebuilding the plugin; reuse a ClassDB export "
"from the same API build. After synchronization, run ``python scripts/build_docs.py``. Reference "
"classes and enums with canonical :ref:`class_* <class_FmodServer>` and ``enum_*`` labels rather "
"than editing generated pages."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:73 c5a52a8ddc8f46cda8d322db35eae9dc
msgid "编辑器属性与界面翻译"
msgstr "Editor properties and interface translations"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:75 142fdfbf38ab48f0979826239305fcd1
msgid ""
"打开 **项目 > 工具 > FMOD Translations**，选择属性、编辑器界面或 API 文档目录。修改现有条目后保存，并切换编辑器语言检查实际显示。PO 编辑需要 Python 与"
" Babel，可使用文档环境中的 Python。"
msgstr ""
"Open **Project > Tools > FMOD Translations** and select the property, editor-interface, or API-"
"documentation catalog. Save existing-entry edits and switch the editor language to inspect the "
"result. PO editing requires Python and Babel; the documentation environment's Python can be used."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:77 3eba3e7c1d164191aee7eee66e2fe926
msgid ""
"属性与界面翻译分别使用 ``godot.properties`` 和 ``godot.editor`` 域；类帮助使用 "
"``godot.documentation``。修改显示文本时保留运行时标识符、资源路径和枚举值，保持简体中文、繁体中文、日文和俄文界面目录一致。"
msgstr ""
"Property and interface translations use the ``godot.properties`` and ``godot.editor`` domains; "
"class help uses ``godot.documentation``. Preserve runtime identifiers, resource paths, and enum "
"values when changing display text, and keep the Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, "
"Japanese, and Russian interface catalogs consistent."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:79 990cd1d309e9449da9553a430ee7792c
msgid "从 XML 刷新 API 消息使用上面的文档仓库工具；插件界面的源码提取依赖相应的源码工具，缺少工具时可先维护已有条目，不必恢复已移除的外部测试脚本。"
msgstr ""
"Use the documentation-repository tool above to refresh API messages from XML. Source extraction "
"in the plugin interface requires the corresponding source tools. If they are unavailable, "
"existing entries can still be edited; restoring removed external test runners is unnecessary."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:82 8e462b2c2a194715b293d627d81fb094
msgid "提交前检查"
msgstr "Before submitting"

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:84 74fc1618d686441d9fb10f5b1e0d263c
msgid "中英文页面均可构建，变更页面无未翻译或未经确认的条目。"
msgstr "Both language editions build, and changed pages have no untranslated or unreviewed entries."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:85 f41d119c0ec342279a17d2ace16e21f4
msgid "表格、代码块、目录、内部引用和英文页面的段落均正常显示。"
msgstr "Tables, code blocks, navigation, internal references, and English paragraphs render correctly."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:86 e6883996df1c40faa871ce5d6e7869f8
msgid "在 Godot 中检查变更涉及的属性、菜单或类帮助；步骤见 :doc:`testing`。"
msgstr "Check the affected properties, menus, or class help in Godot; see :doc:`testing`."

#: ../../source/contributing/translation.rst:87 bb79373df27747c3b2f7b2c6cbbe6ae3
msgid "说明修改的是手册、插件翻译还是 API 源文件；需要跨仓库同步时链接对应 PR。"
msgstr ""
"State whether the change affects the manual, plugin translations, or API sources. Link companion "
"PRs when cross-repository synchronization is needed."
